              "content": "The repository view becomes a set of sections, Issues, Pull requests, Commits and Workflows, on 1–4, each with its own tools; All, the open count beside the title and grouping by kind are gone. Two layouts, both built: sections as tabs beside the name (CH1, CH2), or a column of the repository's own (CH4, CH5). The user picks one in Settings · Display (CH43, in App · Settings); the owner will try both and then keep the switch or one of them. Commits in both layouts: App · Commits (CH3, CH6, CH42). J1–J3 above show the view before this change.",
