                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "githq knows the user's role in each repository up front, so in vitejs/vite, where mlaine is a contributor, the PR shows its labels, assignees, milestone and reviewers as plain values: no A, L, M or ⇧R keys, no hover affordance, and one quiet line saying why. Pressing L anyway shows the same sentence as a hint, nothing is sent. Comments and the PR's own title and body stay editable. The command menu says the same (E4: “2 of 3 editable”).",
