                      "name": "Caption note",
                      "fill": "$fg-2",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "A marker can stay on for weeks, so it never moves, pulses or grows. It has two levels, computed from GitHub's data with nothing stored: bright for a break younger than 24 hours, quiet after that. It stays red either way and never goes away until a run passes. The marker sits on the repository's icon, so markers line up in one column and the open-items count beside the name stays. The Broken workflows entry is contextual: it appears only while at least one workflow is known to be broken (and while its screen is open), so the sidebar carries no idle row. With nothing broken, or nothing known yet, the screen is still one ⌘K away.",
                      "lineHeight": 1.45,
                      "fontFamily": "$font",
