                      "content": "/ or ⌘F, because the browser's own find can't see lines that aren't drawn. Search runs over the whole job at once, folded steps included: they show their match count, and landing on a match opens its step. This match is the actual cause, 232 lines above the marker, which only said “exit code 1”. Enter or N goes to the next match, ⇧N to the previous, Tab shows only the matching lines, Esc closes and returns to where you were.",
