                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "Jyp8M",
                      "name": "Caption note",
                      "fill": "$fg-2",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "The same page with the sidebar on the rail ([): about 180 pixels more log. W wraps long lines with a hanging indent, off by default so that lines stay scannable and the map stays exact. T shows each line's own timestamp from the log. Both stay on for the next log. The rail keeps the total.",
