                      "content": "After W9. The Alerts bar says in words that failures here never mark the repository broken, so its red rows read as expected. Every failing workflow sits under No alerts, Deploy on main included, with the same quiet red as any failure that isn't news. The tab has no count, and the sidebar no marker for it.",
                      "lineHeight": 1.45,
                      "fontFamily": "$font",
                      "fontSize": 13,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    }
                  ]
                },
