                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "Untrack (⌫, or the button on the row) acts at once, like every other edit in the app: the row leaves the list, the selection moves to the next row, and a toast offers Undo (⌘Z) for 10 seconds. The copy in this browser is deleted only when the toast goes, so Undo is instant and costs no download; leaving Settings meanwhile still deletes it. Re-tracking later is always possible from Track repositories. Shown: fitloop/api just untracked.",
