                      "name": "Caption note",
                      "fill": "$fg-2",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "Projects work like Repositories (G8): only what is tracked, grouped by owner, no ticks. A row shows where its items come from (a tracked project brings its items even from repositories you don't track, so it says how many of those are tracked), its item count and sync status; no visibility tag, which githq doesn't know for a project. Click or Enter opens the project's settings, a page like T16 for when projects get settings of their own; until then it holds Tracking alone. Untrack on the row, at once with Undo, as in Repositories (T20). Track projects (A) and a group's Track more open the picker (T22). Keys: J and K move, Enter opens, ⌫ untracks, A tracks more, 1 to 4 switch sections.",
                      "lineHeight": 1.45,
                      "fontFamily": "$font",
                      "fontSize": 13,
