                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "The bar sits under the toolbar and never moves, folds or changes height: the stack's name and one square per pull request, numbered by its place, the open one with a full outline and a mark under it. Under the bar, at the top of the content, the rows: every pull request of the stack, none folded, K and J right after the neighbours' titles (the states stay aligned, so nothing shifts as the keys move), what stops the stack, the merge. They're content, so they scroll away under the bar. The unfold chevron keeps its place but is hidden while the rows are in view, so nothing shifts when it shows.",
