                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "fNPk8",
                      "name": "Caption note",
                      "fill": "$fg-2",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "nuxt/nuxt, 14 branches side by side. The graph and the rows are split by a divider. By default the graph takes a tenth of the pane's width (here 98 px, six lanes); lanes that don't fit fold into one thicker line at its right edge, and their commits sit on it. J and K still stop on folded commits, and their branch is named on the row.",
