                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "V6pBo0",
                      "name": "Caption note",
                      "fill": "$fg-2",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "On brave-lynx's row, under fix/booking-tz, . opens the worktree's menu; a click on the marker in the graph opens the same one, and is the only way in for a worktree with no branch. Reveal in Finder (Explorer, Files on other platforms) is the first action, Copy path beside it. The folder's path and state head the menu so it is clear which working copy it acts on. Later actions join this menu, not the row.",
                      "lineHeight": 1.45,
                      "fontFamily": "$font",
                      "fontSize": 13,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    }
                  ]
