              "name": "Group title",
              "fill": "$fg",
              "content": "4 · An unsent draft review",
              "fontFamily": "$font",
              "fontSize": 22,
              "fontWeight": "600"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "PZHk7",
              "name": "Group note",
              "fill": "$fg-2",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "The owner's sharpest pain: a review left pending keeps every comment from the author, often an agent, and blocks its replies. While you have one on a pull request, a toolbar at the foot of the diff says so, with the count and the ways out, each asking first; its row in the stack carries an amber dot; lists mark the pull request; and the app's sidebar gets an entry at the very top, only while there is at least one. One begun on github.com may show up here a little late (D21).",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "$font",
              "fontSize": 14,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            }
          ]
        },
